<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia January inflation up 8.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia January inflation up 8.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p>    (changes in percent)	    Jan	 Dec	 Jan 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	   1.0	 0.7	  1.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	     8.9	 8.8	  8.5</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
